  "writing_rules": [
    "This manifest is static continuity reference and never mutable campaign truth; conflicting saved state records a divergence and wins.",
    "Do not bind the campaign anchor without an approved primary-manga work, volume, and chapter locator.",
    "Model memory, wikis, fanon, and unverified summaries cannot approve a source or seed a fact.",
    "Official supplements and anime-compatible material are explicit nonconflicting additions only; they never outrank primary manga.",
    "Only paraphrase source-supported facts. Do not store copied prose.",
    "Visibility controls retrieval, not character knowledge. Restricted and secret facts require saved access or discovery authority before narration as known.",
    "Source and event catalogs are open content collections with stable semantic IDs; adding records of the registered shape is not a structural revision."
  ]
